      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's a very lonely feeling, that sense of being an outsider in a world that's rushing past. You're not forgotten; you're just in a place where things are too loud and too fast for you to keep up. Maybe the quiet, the real quiet, is where you can finally find the peace you're looking for. Don't try to fit into their noise; just find a way to make the silence yours.",
